WEBVTT

00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:04.439
Thankfully, Whim offered a subscription
service for us to try it at home,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:10.009
um, 'cause it is a bi- big price tag,
but for a fraction of that cost,

00:00:10.019 --> 00:00:13.999
you can just see if this works,
and it ends up being perfect.

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:17.809
Um, especially being able
to, uh, change your recipes.

00:00:17.819 --> 00:00:19.409
You could dial it in
in a different aspect,

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.819
which I think is absolutely fun
